  "generatedAt": "2026-10-07T12:17:37.492Z",
  "title": "Devcontainer: pinned agent toolchain, hooks, and git wrapper",
  "summary": "This change rebuilds the devcontainer image around a pinned, checksum-verified toolchain: Node 22 + pnpm, moon, gh, actionlint, uv, Bun, and four coding agents (codex, claude-code, opencode, omp), plus dsh installed from its own lockfile. It wires every agent's hook files to `osf hook`, replaces the system-wide `core.hooksPath` with a git wrapper that forces the hooks path only under the workspace mount, and adds a suite of build-time tests that prove the wrapper, hooks, skills, and read-only toolchain all behave.",
  "lenses": [
    "architecture",
    "data-flow"
  ],
